# EmailJS Configuration (Optional)
# If you wish to enable automated contact form delivery via EmailJS:
# 1. Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add an Email Service (e.g., Gmail)
# 3. Create an Email Template with parameters: {{from_name}}, {{from_email}}, {{subject}}, {{message}}
# 4. Copy your Service ID, Template ID, and Public Key into a .env file:

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here
